  "notable_quotes": [
    "Activated 1 exhibits modest surface area and CO2 uptake, with BET and Langmuir areas of 229.7 and 321.7 m2 g−1 and CO2 uptake of 27 cm3 g−1 at 0 °C, 1 bar.",
    "After solvent exchange and activation, the framework retained crystallinity and showed permanent porosity with a reversible type-I N2 isotherm.",
    "The btc/azole mixed-ligand strategy is presented as an effective way to build cage-based MOFs for enriching or encapsulating guest molecules."
